{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d16","docs":{"io/output/d16/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Sortie physique (relais)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.binding_port.label","help":"Relais physique piloté par cette fonction. « Non connecté » laisse la sortie inerte. Le changement est pris en compte au prochain démarrage.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d16/d16_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 (recopie flowswitch)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, la sortie recopie flowswitch est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_active_high.help"},"io/output/d16/d16_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON (recopie flowswitch)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie recopie flowswitch (D16).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d16/d16_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion (recopie flowswitch)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour la sortie recopie flowswitch (D16).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_momentary.help"},"io/output/d16/d16_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_name.help","label":"Nom sortie recopie flowswitch","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie recopie flowswitch (D16).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_name.help"},"io/output/d16/d16_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion recopie flowswitch (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de la sortie recopie flowswitch (D16).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.d16_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d16/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot (recopie flowswitch)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si la sortie recopie flowswitch (D16) applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d16.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}